# S22: Todo Auth + Shared Workspace

## Objective

Add auth to `apps/todo` (same pattern as S15 work-control). `todo_tasks.user_id`
scoped to session. Add optional shared workspace: tasks can be marked `shared: true`
and appear for all users in the org. First cross-user feature in todo.

## Tasks

- [ ] S22-T01-FreezeInvariants.pd
- [ ] S22-T02-AuthModule.pd             — nuxt-auth-utils in todo app
- [ ] S22-T03-UserScopedTasks.pd        — user_id on todo_tasks, scoped list API
- [ ] S22-T04-SharedWorkspace.pd        — shared flag + org-wide task list view
- [ ] S22-T05-TodoPresence.pd           — presence for todo app (reuse S12 pattern)
- [ ] S22-T06-KnowledgeUpdate.pd        — todo slug: auth + shared workspace
- [ ] S22-T07-TestsSmoke.pd

## Definition of Done

- [ ] Todo tasks scoped to authenticated user
- [ ] Shared tasks visible to all org members
- [ ] Presence shows other viewers on todo (same AvatarStack pattern)
- [ ] `bun run test` green

## App-agent protocol

All tasks follow `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md`.

## Next

**S23:** Supabase production setup — RLS, multi-tenant, migration from SQLite
